      "Text": "Security update for nmap",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for nmap fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-72712: crafted packet containing a zero-length TCP option causes the `Packet:parse_options()` function to\n  allocate objects in an infinite loop and cause an OOM condition (bsc#1275288).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
